Project: mimalloc
URL: https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc
License: MIT
Upstream version: v2.1.7
Local modifications: include/mimalloc_bge_prefix.h (bge_ prefix on every global symbol, included
by mimalloc.h and forced into src/static.c) so it never clashes with the mimalloc inside
Python 3.13+; src/ and include/ only; mimalloc-override.h left out
Used by BGE-Next (WITH_MEM_MIMALLOC): C++ new/delete and Blender's MEM_ allocations.
